        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I thought about this case during implementation. Both then and currently I am not sure if this is a good behavior.\r\n\r\nCouple of questions:\r\n- This, of course, should also be the case for the first argument?\r\n- If there is more than one space, would you expect to ignore all of them?\r\n- Would you also expect `vaa` to ignore whitespace?",
