        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks again for the issue. Should be fixed on latest `main`. It now should ignore left whitespace in first argument, right whitespace on last argument, but include them in case of a single argument (useful to converge into `{}`; use `ia` to not include whitespace).\r\n\r\nIt proved to be far more challenging than it should be, but I think I managed to find compromise by consciously ignoring one quite rare edge case (whole whitespace last argument, like in `f(xx,   )`).",
